      "writtenOn": "2023-05-26T14:15:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The BUILD.gn line is inside a big `if (sanitize !\u003d \"\")` (see my comment below, about preferring good stacks on sanitizer builds vs. performance from omitting frame pointers).\n\nThe bazel one won\u0027t interact with this GN change, but I do wonder why we\u0027re doing that. I\u0027ll ping Kevin to understand what that\u0027s about.",
      "parentUuid": "7e3bec51_beb6d3e5",
      "revId": "405ce5c3efa3de2230553231dcc7a1ac699d5bea",
